  "reviewNotes": "PDF page4 and two 1000px source diagonals. Native datum17 mm and top53.2586 mm. Source side-normal area histograms measure crate axes16.5 and36.5deg. Horizontal boards, vertical corner rails and top end grain have separate axes in each local crate frame. Mustard top sack, brown side sack and sage draped cloth have own measured native domains and woven roughness. Iron fasteners follow rotated corners. Tile is occupied by crates/fabric and has no stand point; paving remains warm sandstone. Both fronts and back folds require visual review. Main paving height measured independently at native[-10,-10], source25.784128/render25.783503/LOD25.777511 mm; no stand point does not reset surfaceHeight to the mounting datum.",
